      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错，所以这次Qwen3.8-Max把这块做强，本质上就是在抢Agent这个赛道的入场券。而且它还号称性能直逼Claude，这个评价可不算低啊，Claude系列一直是编程和推理领域的标杆。",
